hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"28012","Narrated Abdur-Rahman ibn Mahdi, from Sufyan, from Habib meaning Ibn Abi Thabit, from a man, from Umm Muslim Al-Ashjaiyyah, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) came to her while she was in a dome and said: How beautiful it is, if there were no dead animal in it. She said: So I started checking it."
